            "end": 26
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:encounter#e-e7ad2663e99f1274",
          "text": "During his years of reporting, one of his most memorable experiences is one in Nantong, where he encountered self-made business people in the textile（纺织）industry who built international enterprises out of nothing.",
          "source": {
